.TH SSGRID 1 2000-1月 "sgrid_coefficients" "sgrid_coefficients"
.SH NAME
sgrid_coefficients \- get the coefficient matrix of the fitted S-system model
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsgrid_coefficients(\fBnetwork\fR as <generic> SSystemNetwork, 
\fBtype\fR as string = "net", 
\fBoriginal\fR as boolean = TRUE, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get the coefficient matrix of the fitted S-system model
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBnetwork\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtype\fB \fR\- 
 the matrix type: \fBnet\fR(default, the net elasticity \fBg - h\fR), 
 \fBg\fR(the kinetic order of the synthesis term) or 
 \fBh\fR(the kinetic order of the degradation term).
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBoriginal\fB \fR\- 
 use the original gene symbol instead of the sanitized gene id? default is TRUE.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a wide dataframe: the rows are the target genes and the columns are the 
 regulators. the matrix element is the fitted coefficient.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
let net = sgrid_coefficients(network);
 let g = sgrid_coefficients(network, type = "g");
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ssGrid
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
